# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# What this repo is for: versioning the ~700 text files that get
# edited — markdown, HTML, CSS, scripts, SVG, PDFs, the .docx
# training sources. NOT a backup tool for 3.2 GB of raw footage.
# Media excluded here still needs a real backup elsewhere.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Raw video: 3.2 GB, never edited in place, back up separately
*.mov
*.MOV
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.avi
# --- except the finished site hero (2 MB each, part of the deployable site)
!surge/website/build/assets/video/hero.mp4
!surge/website/build/assets/video/hero.webm

# --- Camera originals
*.heic
*.HEIC

# --- Archives / site bundles
*.zip
*.wpress
**/deploy/dist/

# --- The big photo tree (~500 MB) — but keep the notes written inside it
surge/brand/photos/**
!surge/brand/photos/**/
!surge/brand/photos/**/*.md

# --- Archive payload: superseded, duplicated and unrelated material.
#     Keep the record of what was set aside, not the bytes.
_archive/**
!_archive/
!_archive/README.md
!_archive/MOVE-MANIFEST-2026-09-13.csv

# --- Regenerable dependency trees (npm install rebuilds)
node_modules/

# --- OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*~
